{"page":45,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:265","surah":2,"ayah":265,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَثَلُ ٱلَّذِينَ يُنفِقُونَ أَمْوَٰلَهُمُ ٱبْتِغَآءَ مَرْضَاتِ ٱللَّهِ وَتَثْبِيتًا مِّنْ أَنفُسِهِمْ كَمَثَلِ جَنَّةٍۭ بِرَبْوَةٍ أَصَابَهَا وَابِلٌ فَـَٔاتَتْ أُكُلَهَا ضِعْفَيْنِ فَإِن لَّمْ يُصِبْهَا وَابِلٌ فَطَلٌّ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ بَصِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But those who spend their wealth in order to gain God’s approval, and as an affirmation of their own faith, are like a garden on a hill: heavy rain falls and it produces double its normal yield; even if no heavy rain falls, it will still be watered by the dew. God sees all that you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَثَلُ","en_gloss":"And (the) example","transliteration":"wamathalu","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُنفِقُونَ","en_gloss":"spend","transliteration":"yunfiqūna","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَمْوَٰلَهُمُ","en_gloss":"their wealth","transliteration":"amwālahumu","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱبْتِغَآءَ","en_gloss":"seeking","transliteration":"ib'tighāa","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَرْضَاتِ","en_gloss":"(the) pleasure","transliteration":"marḍāti","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَتَثْبِيتًۭا","en_gloss":"and certainty","transliteration":"watathbītan","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَنفُسِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their (inner) souls","transliteration":"anfusihim","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَمَثَلِ","en_gloss":"(is) like","transliteration":"kamathali","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":12,"ar":"جَنَّةٍۭ","en_gloss":"a garden","transliteration":"jannatin","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِرَبْوَةٍ","en_gloss":"on a height","transliteration":"birabwatin","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَصَابَهَا","en_gloss":"fell on it","transliteration":"aṣābahā","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَابِلٌۭ","en_gloss":"heavy rain","transliteration":"wābilun","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فَـَٔاتَتْ","en_gloss":"so it yielded","transliteration":"faātat","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أُكُلَهَا","en_gloss":"its harvest","transliteration":"ukulahā","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ضِعْفَيْنِ","en_gloss":"double","transliteration":"ḍiʿ'fayni","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":19,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"Then if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":20,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"(does) not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":21,"ar":"يُصِبْهَا","en_gloss":"fall (on) it","transliteration":"yuṣib'hā","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":22,"ar":"وَابِلٌۭ","en_gloss":"heavy rain","transliteration":"wābilun","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":23,"ar":"فَطَلٌّۭ ۗ","en_gloss":"then a drizzle","transliteration":"faṭallun","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":24,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":25,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":26,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"you do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":27,"ar":"بَصِيرٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Seer","transliteration":"baṣīrun","verse_key":"2:265"},{"pos":28,"ar":"٢٦٥","en_gloss":"(265)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:265"}]},{"verse_key":"2:266","surah":2,"ayah":266,"ar_uthmani":"أَيَوَدُّ أَحَدُكُمْ أَن تَكُونَ لَهُۥ جَنَّةٌ مِّن نَّخِيلٍ وَأَعْنَابٍ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ لَهُۥ فِيهَا مِن كُلِّ ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ وَأَصَابَهُ ٱلْكِبَرُ وَلَهُۥ ذُرِّيَّةٌ ضُعَفَآءُ فَأَصَابَهَآ إِعْصَارٌ فِيهِ نَارٌ فَٱحْتَرَقَتْ ۗ كَذَٰلِكَ يُبَيِّنُ ٱللَّهُ لَكُمُ ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَتَفَكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Would any of you like to have a garden of palm trees and vines, graced with flowing streams and all kinds of produce, which, when you are afflicted with old age and feeble offspring, is struck by a fiery whirlwind and burnt down? In this way God makes His messages clear to you, so that you may reflect on them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَيَوَدُّ","en_gloss":"Would like","transliteration":"ayawaddu","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَحَدُكُمْ","en_gloss":"any of you","transliteration":"aḥadukum","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَكُونَ","en_gloss":"it be","transliteration":"takūna","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":6,"ar":"جَنَّةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a garden","transliteration":"jannatun","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نَّخِيلٍۢ","en_gloss":"date-palms","transliteration":"nakhīlin","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأَعْنَابٍۢ","en_gloss":"and grapevines","transliteration":"wa-aʿnābin","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَجْرِى","en_gloss":"flowing","transliteration":"tajrī","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"[from]","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَحْتِهَا","en_gloss":"underneath it","transliteration":"taḥtihā","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ","en_gloss":"the rivers","transliteration":"l-anhāru","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":17,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"all (kinds)","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) [the] fruits","transliteration":"l-thamarāti","verse_key":"2:266"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَأَصَابَهُ","en_gloss":"and strikes him","transliteration":"wa-aṣābahu","verse_ke